  "The series title page: «Bibliothek arabischer Historiker und Geographen», edited by Hans v. Mžik, third volume: the «Kitāb ṣūrat al-arḍ» of Abū Ǧaʿfar Muḥammad ibn Mūsā al-Ḫuwārizmī, Arabic text; 1926, Otto Harrassowitz, Leipzig. Set in Roman capitals, with three lines in black letter (Fraktur), transcribed in Roman type: «Dritter Band:» (L06), «Arabischer Text» (L10) and «Otto Harrassowitz · Leipzig» (L12). A rule separates the date from the publisher's line.",
